    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1083">

                <pb facs="1108" n="822" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg822"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.6211/394</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Gerard</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-07-11T13:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 11, 1916, 1 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received July 12, 3 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4104. Your telegram 3157 of July 5, 11 a. m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1083-f1"/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Note verbale</hi> of December 18, 1914, as stated in my
                    3882 of May 12, 4 p. m., was never answered, but in January 1915, some papers
                    without any covering note or letter were returned. Weston, an Englishman of
                    British relief, claims all papers not returned, but difficult to settle this as
                    he was in solitary confinement for months and now in Ruhleben. There was no
                    written apology, but Zimmermann asked me
                    as a favor to let matter drop.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gerard</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
